# IMP-0017 — line-ending policy enforced at build time (not developer discipline).
# Shell / PS1 / Python / Markdown check out as LF. Packer additionally refuses any
# shipped *.sh blob that contains CR (0x0D); the gate reads git cat-file / git show
# blob bytes (never working-tree, never git archive).
*.sh eol=lf
*.ps1 eol=lf
*.py eol=lf
*.md eol=lf

